id=minsos_mediaperm
name=MinsOS Android/media group fix
version=v1
versionCode=1
author=MinsOS
description=I-188 and I-191. Folders that apps made under Android/media and Android/data while sdcardfs was on keep a group that cannot be written through once sdcardfs is off (tablet 2.0.0-beta2, phone 2.0.0-beta5). After each unlock, Android/media entries move to media_rw (1023) and each app's Android/data entries go back to the app's uid with ext_data_rw (1078), both with group write.
